    "sub_name": "健康產業管理",
    "sub_ename": "HEALTH INDUSTRY MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "基於健康產業發展趨勢，推廣學生具備【新健康思維】觀念，健康可以形成個人競爭力，有健康身體及思維，才能維持家庭和樂，並於競爭激烈的就業職場確保個人職場表現及生存，甚者提升整體國家競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "Based on trend of health industry, this course promotes students to have the concept of \"new health\", which is believed to enhance personal competitiveness. With a healthy body and mind, we maintain family harmony and ensure individual performance and survival in the workplace, and to enhance overall national competitiveness.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解健康產業目前遇到的難題與需要的資源。",
      "describe_en": "Understand the challenges and needed resources of the health industry."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "從台灣及國際的健康產業案例，讓學生尋找未來就業機會。",
      "describe_en": "Looking for the employment opportunity from the cases of health industry in Taiwan and the world."
    }
